{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24095","headline":"旱热二首 二 · 白居易","name":"旱热二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勃勃旱尘气，炎炎赤日光。\n飞禽颭将坠，行人渴欲狂。\n壮者不耐饥，饥火烧其肠。\n肥者不禁热，喘急汗如浆。\n此时方自悟，老瘦亦何妨。\n肉轻足健逸，发少头清凉。\n薄食不饥渴，端居省衣裳。\n数匙粱饭冷，一领绡衫香。\n持此聊过日，焉知畏景长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}